# Homelabs cluster kubeconfig

When running **any** kubectl or cluster-related commands for this project, always set:

```bash
export KUBECONFIG=~/.kube/config-homelabs
```

Then run kubectl (e.g. `kubectl top nodes --sort-by=memory`, `kubectl get nodes`, `kubectl get pods -A`, etc.).

Do not use `KUBECONFIG=~/.kube/config` or assume a different config for this cluster.
